// Batch 11 — All-Time Best lists (added 2026-05-08)
//
// Definitive ranked-list series. Article 61 covers the cross-genre
// "best of all time" canon; articles 62-65 cover the per-subgenre
// canon (uplifting, progressive, psy, vocal). Track entries follow a
// structured `tracks` shape on each post — rank, artist, title, label,
// year, genre, plus a bilingual review — which the [slug] handler
// uses to emit ItemList + MusicRecording JSON-LD on top of the
// existing BlogPosting schema. The renderer falls back to the body
// content sections when `tracks` is absent, so the addition is
// non-breaking for the existing 60 posts.
//
// Sourcing: every track below is cross-checked against Discogs,
// Wikipedia, label release pages, ASOT 1000 / DJ Mag retrospective
// rankings, and Mixmag historical "Best Trance Track Ever" coverage.
// Year and label correspond to the original release; later
// remixes / re-releases are noted in the review where culturally
// relevant.

