      description: 'Twenty-five psytrance records ranked by Boom Festival / Ozora / Universo Paralello mainstage rotation, Beatport psy chart placements, and verifiable streaming counts — Hallucinogen, Astral Projection, Infected Mushroom, Vini Vici, Astrix, Shpongle and the Goa-to-full-on records that defined the subgenre.',
